{"crw-nogi-33907":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の夏の画像がフォルダ漁ってたら出てきたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏っぽいね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなは夏らしいことしてるー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはスイカ沢山食べたり、夏休みの宿題してる〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年乃木坂に入ってから夏は全国ツアーができて\nこうして今、全国まわってると\n今年も夏がきた〜ってかんじ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場に綺麗なお花をありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪ではたこ焼きをたべ、満員のファンの方が迎えてくれて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋では味噌カツをたべ、ファンの方もメンバーやスタッフさんも大阪に負けないぐらいの盛り上がりで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は仙台と福岡だね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達も全力の笑顔とダンスで盛り上がるので、待っててください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、また美味しいの食べれるのも楽しみ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてラストはバースデーライブの神宮ライブだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的に夏の締めくくりって気分"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで気を抜かず頑張っていきます〜‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番奥の席まで笑顔が届きますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前あみちゃんが急に\n「まあやんち行きたいー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」\nって言って泊まりにきたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜3時ぐらいまでお話して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂はいったりして 一緒に寝たよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その次の日がアルバム特典のイベントだったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初詣以来の乃木神社でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか清められた感じがします(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神社好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が来てくださいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い中遠くから来てくださったり\n短い時間でしたがありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"午後の黒ひげゲーム？っていうのかな？あのイベントはなんか新鮮で、それもあっという間の時間だったなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのグループは4回もパーフェクト出てサインプレゼント出来きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応募してくださった方！来てくださった方ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても素敵な時間を一緒に過ごせて楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい夏休みの思い出が１つ増えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ中の楽屋とか車移動はいつもひなちまと一緒にいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちかが早く着いたら席とって待ってたりするぐらい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前は一緒にご飯食べに行ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまいつもありがとね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥誕生日おめでとう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一期生最年少同士！初期の頃から歳も同じなので仲良くて、この前おうちのプリクラ昔のとか見てたら飛鳥との沢山出てきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちが中学の頃のプリクラもあって飛鳥が落書きで我らの友情永遠不滅なり！って書いてて時代感じたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと他の言い方なかったんかいね( › ·̮ ‹ )笑でもなんか面白かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また取ろうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きだよ〜！！\n素敵な一年になりますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0024.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇねぇお花ってどうやったら長持ちするのかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"置く場所とかで違うのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐ枯れちゃうから悲しいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもとっても綺麗だよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に前回の8月6日のブログに沢山の言葉をもらいました。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も みんなが笑顔でありますように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-32394":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPPY90X32BF66CS16S175Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">あおたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギターを買いました🎸"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPPZ7BS2MF8RP82J27Q4NY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">色は白と黒です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな曲が弾けるようになるといいな〜\n全くの初心者なので難しいですが毎日少しづつ進めています。\n今は、けいおんの　Don't say“lazy”を練習中です🍚\nとても楽しいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指先が硬くなってきた気がする✋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メッセージでちゃんとかっこいいのが送れるように頑張ろ〜\n長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-34154":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事に4th BIRTHDAY LIVE\nが終わりました〜(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/01/5562654/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年２月２２日に乃木坂46の\nデビュー日お祝いするこのライブ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は２月２２日に出来なかったけど\n神宮球場にて３日間で\n無事に終えることが出来ました◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台風の影響で\n雨が降っていたにも関わらず\nお祝いに駆けつけてくださった\n皆さんありがとうございましたm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BIRTHDAY LIVEは\n1stシングルから順番に\nその楽曲のオリジナルメンバーで\nやっていくコンセプト。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は２期生だから\nシングルに初めて参加した\n８枚目からしか登場出来ないのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1枚目から卒業生のポジションだったり\n全員参加の曲から参加させて貰ったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは１日目から。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"M00. overture\n◎M01. ぐるぐるカーテン\n◎M02. 会いたかったかもしれない\n◎M03. 左胸の勇気\n◎M04. 失いたくないから\n◎M05. 乃木坂の詩\n◎M06. 白い雲にのって\n-映像-\n◎M07. おいでシャンプー\n◎M08. ハウス！\n◎M09. 心の薬\nM10. 偶然を言い訳にして\nM11. 狼に口笛を\nM12. 水玉模様\n-VTR-\n-MC-\n◎M13. 走れ！bicycle\n◎M14. 人はなぜ走るのか？\nM15. 涙がまだ悲しみだった頃\nM16. 音が出ないギター\nM17. 海流の島よ\nM18. せっかちなかたつむり\n-VTR-\nM19. 渋谷ブルース\nM20. ここじゃないどこか\nM21. やさしさなら間に合ってる\nM22. 制服のマネキン\nM23. 指望遠鏡\n◎M24. 春のメロディー\n-MC-\nM25. 200ギガあげちゃう\nM26. なぞの落書き\nM27. 傾斜する\nM28. 誰かは味方\nM29. 僕がいる場所\nM30. あなたのために弾きたい\nM31. 革命の馬\nM32. ひとりよがり\n◎M33. 自由の彼方\n-VTR-\nM34. ロマンティックいか焼き\nM35. シャキイズム\nM36. サイコキネシスの可能性\nM37. でこぴん\n◎M38. 13日の金曜日\n-VTR-\n◎M39. 君の名は希望"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎EN1. ガールズルール\n◎EN2. 夏のFree&Easy\n◎EN3. 太陽ノック\n-MC-\n◎EN4. 裸足でSummer"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(◎は出演楽曲です)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その頃の思い出とか\nこの曲は個人的に思い入れがあるとか\nそれぞれファンの皆さんと\n歴史を振り返られる\nLIVEだと思うんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はこの時まだ乃木坂46に加入\nしていない時期だったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１期生の方とファンの方が\n築きあげてきた楽曲を\nやらせてもらうことを噛み締めながら\nパフォーマンスしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この頃のメンバーの苦労とか\n喜びとかは感じることは出来ないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しく入ることで曲に厚みが出たら\nいいななんて思います。\n歴史の振り返り方はそれぞれだし\nこのライブでもまたこの楽曲の\n新しい思い出が出来たら幸いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/01/5562654/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも\n当時ただの大学生だった私が\n今、アイドルとしてステージに\n立っているから\nやっぱり人生は何があるか\nわからないなと改めて感じる１日目でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１日目のハイライトはもちろん\nせっかちなかたつむりを\nフルサイズで出来たこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超絶かわいいコール\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またこの曲を出来るかもわからないし\n私が担当させて頂けるなんて\n思っていないです。\nでもあの瞬間私は本当に幸せでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲については\nいろいろ話したいことがあるので\nラジオかブログでまた\nお伝えしますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく楽しかった１日目\nアンコールとか雨凄かったけど\n皆さんの熱気も\n凄くて弾けられました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さん\n夏の思い出をありがとうございますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからの乃木坂46も\nどうぞよろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/01/5562654/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/01/5562654/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","tex